\section{Against ar1()}{
\code{\link[=ar1]{ar1()}} is the case \eqn{q = 1} written out: there the autocorrelation is
\eqn{\rho^{h}}, the determinant is \eqn{(1-\rho^2)^{p-1}} and the inverse is
